stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> unauthenticated

  unauthenticated --> logging_in: login(actorId)
  logging_in --> authenticated: loginSucceeded / persist accessToken, refreshToken & expiresAt
  logging_in --> unauthenticated: loginFailed / keep session empty

  authenticated --> expired: checkExpiration (clock >= expiresAt)
  authenticated --> refreshing: 401 response / startRefresh
  authenticated --> unauthenticated: logout / purge session & tokens

  expired --> refreshing: startRefresh / initiate token renewal
  expired --> unauthenticated: logout / purge session & tokens

  refreshing --> authenticated: refreshSucceeded / update tokens & new expiresAt, retry queued
  refreshing --> unauthenticated: refreshFailed / purge session & tokens securely
  refreshing --> unauthenticated: logout / cancel renewal & purge tokens

  note right of authenticated
    CampusOps profiles:
    reporter creates and views own incidents.
    technician resolves assigned incidents.
    coordinator closes or reopens incidents.
    UI visibility never replaces authorization checks.
  end note

  note right of refreshing
    Single-flight coordination:
    concurrent 401 requests share the same refresh,
    and every pending request is retried at most once.
    On failure, state returns safely to unauthenticated.
  end note
